  },
  {
   "name": "C3: Two-stage additive refit",
   "description": "Fit TreeHFD twice: first pass obtains residuals r = f(x) - predicted components; train small ridge regressions g_j on each component's own variable subset against r, adding corrections h_j(z_j); final prediction sums original components plus per-variable corrections, preserving functional dependence structure."
  }
